diterranean views. This luxury property offers expansive living areas, seven bedrooms, elegant terraces and beautifully landscaped gardens designed for privacy and comfort.\n\nThe villa opens with a dramatic double height entrance hall with wooden beams and a statement chandelier. Two elegant living rooms lead to a large covered terrace facing the sea. The property includes a formal dining room and a bright modern kitchen with a central island. The ground floor also features two ensuite bedrooms with marble bathrooms.\n\nThe first floor hosts the impressive master suite with private lounge area, two dressing rooms and breathtaking sea views. Five further bedrooms complete the upper level. ‌A ‌600 ‌m² ‌basement ‌provides ‌parking for ‌up to ‌ten cars and includes staff ‌accommodation. ‌The ‌mature ‌gardens ‌surround a large swimming ‌pool ‌and ‌open ‌directly ‌to ‌the ‌beach."},"features":{"es":["Primera línea de Playa","Lado de la Playa","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Sur","Excelente","Privada","Aire Acondicionado","Chimenea","Mar","Panorámicas","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","Sala de Juegos","Trastero","Lavadero","Doble acristalamiento","Amueblada","Opcionales","Parcialmente Equipada","Privado","Alarma","Más de uno","Privado","Teléfono","Frente a la playa","Lujo"],"en":["Beachfront","Beachside","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","South","Excellent","Private","Air Conditioning","Fireplace","Sea","Panoramic","Garden","Pool","Covered Terrace","Fitted Wardrobes","Near Transport","Private Terrace","Games Room","Storage Room","Utility Room","Double Glazing","Fully Furnished","Optional","Partially Fitted","Private","Alarm System","More Than One","Private","Telephone","Beachfront","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available"}